  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "しんぴてきで　ちからづよい　まいを\nはげしく　おどる。　じぶんの\nこうげきと　すばやさを　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "신비롭고 힘센 춤을\n격렬하게 춘다. 자신의\n공격과 스피드를 올린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "激烈地跳起神秘又強而有力的舞蹈。\n提高自己的攻擊和速度。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une danse mystique dont le rythme effréné\naugmente l’Attaque et la Vitesse du lanceur.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein mystischer Tanz, der den Angriffs- und\nInitiative-Wert erhöht.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Danza mística que sube el Ataque y la Velocidad.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Danza mistica e vigorosa che aumenta l’Attacco\ne la Velocità di chi la usa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user vigorously performs a mystic, powerful\ndance that raises its Attack and Speed stats.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "神秘的で　力強い　舞を\n激しく　おどる。　自分の\n攻撃と　素早さを　あげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "激烈地跳起神秘且\n强有力的舞蹈。\n从而提高自己的攻击和速度。",
      "version_group": {
